===Noun===
{{en-noun|-}}

# The act of making a previously [[criminal]] activity no longer treatable as a [[criminal offence]].<!--but not the same as legalisation-->
#: {{ux|en|the '''decriminalization''' of all plant-based psychedelics}}
# The act of turning a [[criminal]] into a non-criminal by making their activities [[legal]].

